+# Iteration 17 Consolidation
+
+## Accepted Progress
+
+- Promoted the equal-low multi-low single-drought formula. In the formal left-limit deterministic known-path model, for
+\[
+h^M,0^{N_0},\ell,0^{N_1},\ell,\ldots,0^{N_r},\ell,0^L,h,
+\]
